      Vadlamudi, Antoaneta Vladimirova, Artur Yakimovich, Xiaoxue Yang, Sedef Akinli 
      Kocak, Angela M Cheung. Originally published in the Journal of Medical Internet 
      Research (https://www.jmir.org), 19.09.2023.
